array Updated particle positions in the system, shape (N, 3), units: nanometers. v_xyz_full : ndarray Updated particle velocities in the system, shape (N, 3), units: nanometers/ps. L : float Updated length of the cubic simulation box's side, units: nanometers. Raises: ------- Exception: If the Berendsen barostat has shrunk the box such that the side length L is less than twice the cutoff radius. ''' np.random.seed(17896)
